      "@id": "kaibab:overview/initial",
      "@type": "schema:Collection",
      "dcterms:description": "At 1900: 4,000 deer, 100 predators and 317,000 metric tons of forage. Vensim reads the workbook cells C7, C11 and C9 on the Kaibab Variables sheet. Stella declares stock initial values and supports imported overrides.",
